    - target: {fileID: 2298647161643049540, guid: 0222a1b4f9c504f4cb194ba535c119ea, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "That\u2019s Correct!\n\nSubstitute the factorials into the combination
        formula\n\n_7C_4 = \\frac{7!}{(7 - 4)! 4!}\n\nSimplify the expression\n\n_7C_4
        = \\frac{7!}{3! 4!}\n\nSubstitute the factorial values\n\n_7C_4 = \\frac{5040}{6
        \\times 24}\n\nMultiply the denominator\n\n_7C_4 = \\frac{5040}{144}\n\nDivide\n\n_7C_4
        = 35"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
